 was written uncancelled, and a crash in the write left the token's traffic at zero. A new token name (Update) is written to the token's file: it rewrote the usage file, so the name was lost on a restart. Token creation (AccessTokenService.Create, FileAccessManager.CreateToken) is async with a required token, as are its callers: the server's gen command and the test helper's CreateAccessToken. Rule 16 says where a required token goes when optional parameters follow Tested: the whole VpnHood.Test and VpnHood.AppLib.Test (but VpnTunnelLockTest's three, which another app's tunnel lock fails here), with two new tests: a new name survives a restart, and a failed usage write leaves the usage as it was.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"kyegomez/swarms","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T02:10:34Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"c1020d6dce9ddc1c88e6f90af606a05cb0375094","github_link":"https://github.com/kyegomez/swarms/commit/c1020d6dce9ddc1c88e6f90af606a05cb0375094","commit_subject":"[FIX][AgentRearrange._reset_conversation][Stop resuming a saved transcript at the start of every run] (#3099)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"kyegomez/swarms","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T02:09:08Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"10610644e606b2f5a9a7bed17ceed666cb1ccf54","github_link":"https://github.com/kyegomez/swarms/commit/10610644e606b2f5a9a7bed17ceed666cb1ccf54","commit_subject":"[FIX][MajorityVoting._run_voters][Raise when a voter fails instead of casting its error as a vote] (#3095)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"openfootmanager/openfootmanager","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T02:08:09Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"ced8939e2bb2079406a0eab060085be28ad6a801","github_link":"https://github.com/openfootmanager/openfootmanager/commit/ced8939e2bb2079406a0eab060085be28ad6a801","commit_subject":"fix(ui): the position chips wait for the position table","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"JasperFx/polecat","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T02:07:46Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"8d042530